  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish Organisation Strategy for the CGIAR Partnership 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Denmark will contribute to CGIAR achieving its goals in the Strategy 2030 within the overall objective to encourage and enable a green food systems transformation in the context of climate change,
taking the challenges of climate change adaptation and mitigation (reducing GHG emissions) fully on board.</narrative>
  </description>
